      {
        "Id": "5607b53d698d444db056a76151d7c5d5",
        "Title": "HOW TO USE  -  model / link your pipes and ducts, set the clearance, Run\nEvery pipe / duct passing through a wall or slab gets an opening = size + clearance (50 mm pipe + 10 -> 60 mm, 50x50 duct + 10 -> 60x60).\nSlabs: round openings for round pipes, rectangles for ducts.  Walls: rectangular openings (Revit wall openings are rectangular).\nAfter MEP changes just Run again: openings are resized / moved / removed to match - never duplicated.",
        "DescriptionText": null,
